<title>HONG KONG: Ayala Corp unit launches US$75 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp unit launches US$75 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger BT Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER    AC INTERNATIONAL FINANCE LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR   AYALA CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$75 MLN   COUPON    6ML+90   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	LAUNCH    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	  CALLS     NONE     REPLIES   19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING     LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET   DENOMS    US$10K</p>
<p> RATING	NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG     YES	   CRS DEF   YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   ENGLISH  PAY DATE  29.NOV.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    US$6-9 MLN   75BP   ALL-IN  105</p>
<p>   SENIOR MGRS     US$4-5 MLN   70BP   ALL-IN  104</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	  US$1-3 MLN   65BP   ALL-IN  103</p>
<p> ARRANGER   BT ASIA</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGERS   CHINATRUST COMMERCIAL BANK, CREDIT LYONNAIS,</p>
<p>		    DEVELOPMENT BANK OF SINGAPORE AND IBJ ASIA</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
